        "make a telephone call to the sender."
      ],
      "justification": "Direct paraphrase of calling the sender."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n8"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "complete the data by adding the incoming mail number, date, and record it in the letter book."
      ],
      "justification": "Direct paraphrase of completing the data."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n9"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Every Wednesday evening, take the letter book and member register to Miranda."
      ],
      "justification": "Captures taking records to Miranda, implying convergence of the completeness check branches."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n10",
